WEBVTT

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:01.700
别动。
Don't move.

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:06.300
告诉我……
Tell me...

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.800
你到底是从哪里来的？
Where did you come from?

00:00:10.248 --> 00:00:12.548
她：（不挣开）我是楼上宴会的摄影师。你的眼睛怎么回事？
Her: (Doesn't pull away.) I'm the photographer for the party upstairs. What's wrong with your eyes?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 1 轮 · Realtime round 1）

00:00:12.648 --> 00:00:14.976
她：我是楼上的摄影师。你的眼睛怎么回事？
I'm the photographer upstairs. Your eyes?

00:00:15.176 --> 00:00:17.504
那是你害的。
That's your doing.

00:00:20.216 --> 00:00:22.528
Harland把订婚宣布提前了，只剩十分钟。
Harland moved the engagement up. Ten minutes.

00:00:22.728 --> 00:00:25.040
Luca，关掉车库监控。谁也别下来。
Luca. Kill the garage cameras. Nobody comes down.

00:00:27.852 --> 00:00:30.152
她：你说我害的？我到底做了什么？
Her: My doing? What did I actually do?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 2 轮 · Realtime round 2）

00:00:30.252 --> 00:00:32.580
她：我到底做了什么？
What did I even do?

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:35.108
是你的气味。
It's your scent.

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:40.132
原来你在这里。
There you are.

00:00:40.332 --> 00:00:42.644
Mate。你就是这个。
Mate. That's what you are.

00:00:45.456 --> 00:00:47.756
她：Mate是什么意思？你说清楚再说跟你走。
Her: What does Mate mean? Explain before I go with you.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 3 轮 · Realtime round 3）

00:00:47.856 --> 00:00:50.184
她：Mate？你先解释清楚。
Mate? Explain first.

00:00:50.384 --> 00:00:52.712
是命定属于我的那一个。只有一个。
The one meant for me. Only one.

00:00:52.912 --> 00:00:54.722
不在这里。进去再问我。
Not here. Ask me inside.

00:00:58.941 --> 00:01:00.750
现在我身上全是你的气味。狼会知道的。
Your scent is on me now. Wolves will know.

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:05.360
她：我把手覆上他的拳头。
Her: I lay my hand over his fist.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 4 轮 · Realtime round 4）

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:07.788
她：我不会受伤的。
I won't be hurt.

00:01:07.988 --> 00:01:10.316
小心。
Careful.

00:01:13.028 --> 00:01:15.340
你还不该信我。
You shouldn't trust me yet.

00:01:18.052 --> 00:01:20.364
让他们来。
Let them come.

00:01:20.664 --> 00:01:22.964
她：他们是谁？为什么要让他们来？
Her: Who are they? Why let them come?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 5 轮 · Realtime round 5）

00:01:23.064 --> 00:01:25.392
她：她：他们是谁？为什么要让他们来？
Who are they? Why let them come?

00:01:25.592 --> 00:01:27.920
我的族人。他们会循着你的气味来。
My own blood. They'll follow your scent.

00:01:28.120 --> 00:01:30.432
来。进去你就明白了。
Come. You'll understand inside.

00:01:33.144 --> 00:01:35.456
是我的气味。会好的。
It's my scent. It'll settle.

00:01:38.268 --> 00:01:40.568
她：我跟你走进起居室。
Her: I follow you into the living room.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 6 轮 · Realtime round 6）

00:01:40.668 --> 00:01:42.996
她：我跟你走。
I'll follow you.

00:01:43.196 --> 00:01:45.524
来，里面暖和。
Come. It's warm inside.

00:01:50.748 --> 00:01:53.060
闻到你气味的那一刻，我就丢下了订婚。
I walked out on my engagement the moment I smelled you.

00:01:53.260 --> 00:01:55.572
你在发抖。
You're shaking.

00:01:55.872 --> 00:01:58.172
她：我不是冷。你丢下订婚，然后呢？
Her: I'm not cold. You walked out on the engagement. Then what?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 7 轮 · Realtime round 7）

00:01:58.272 --> 00:02:00.600
她：我不是冷。那然后呢？
I'm not cold. Then what?

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:03.128
那你就是在怕。怕我？
Then you're afraid. Of me?

00:02:03.328 --> 00:02:05.138
那我就留住你。在这里。今晚。
Then I keep you. Here. Tonight.

00:02:09.357 --> 00:02:11.166
Alpha，Selene Arkwright到了。
Alpha. Selene Arkwright is here.

00:02:13.476 --> 00:02:15.776
她：Selene是谁？让她进来，我倒要看看。
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 8 轮 · Realtime round 8）

00:02:15.876 --> 00:02:18.204
她：我要见Selene，让她进来。
Who is Selene? Let her in.

00:02:18.404 --> 00:02:20.732
我的婚约。现在不是了。
My engagement. Not anymore.

00:02:20.932 --> 00:02:23.244
让她进来。
Let her in.

00:02:23.444 --> 00:02:25.756
原来是真的。
So it's true.

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:33.380
她：我走过去，把手贴上他的脸。
Her: I walk over and lay my hand on his face.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 9 轮 · Realtime round 9）

00:02:36.008 --> 00:02:38.336
她：我不是在怕你。
I'm not afraid.

00:02:38.536 --> 00:02:40.848
那是什么？
Then what is it?

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:45.872

Thirty years. I never waited for anyone.

00:02:48.684 --> 00:02:50.984
她：我也不知道。但你得保证，没人能带走我。
Her: I don't know either. But promise me nobody can take me.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 10 轮 · Realtime round 10）

00:02:51.084 --> 00:02:53.412
她：我不知道。你得向我保证。
I don't know. Promise me.

00:02:53.612 --> 00:02:55.940
没人能带走你。我发誓。
No one takes you. I swear.

00:02:58.150 --> 00:02:59.959
来。我带你看。
Come. Let me show you.

00:03:02.169 --> 00:03:03.978
在这里，没人能碰你。
Nobody touches you here.

00:03:06.288 --> 00:03:08.588
她：我握紧他的手，说我留下
Her: I grip his hand and say I'll stay
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 11 轮 · Realtime round 11）

00:03:08.688 --> 00:03:11.016
她：我留下。
I'm staying.

00:03:11.216 --> 00:03:13.544
再说一遍。
Say it again.

00:03:18.768 --> 00:03:21.080
三十年。而你留下了。
Thirty years. And you stay.

00:03:23.892 --> 00:03:26.192
她：我踮起脚，吻上他的唇。
Her: I rise on tiptoe and kiss him.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 12 轮 · Realtime round 12）

00:03:26.292 --> 00:03:28.620
她：我哪儿也不去。
I'm not going anywhere.

00:03:28.820 --> 00:03:31.148
过来。
Come here.

00:03:38.884 --> 00:03:41.196
三十年，每一夜都值得。
Thirty years. Worth every night.

00:03:41.496 --> 00:03:43.796
她：那是什么声音？是他们来了吗？
Her: What's that sound? Are they here?
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 13 轮 · Realtime round 13）

00:03:43.896 --> 00:03:46.224
她：她：是他们来了吗？
Is that them? Are they here?

00:03:46.424 --> 00:03:48.752
他：是长老会在召集。还没到这里。
Elders. They're calling. Not here yet.

00:03:48.952 --> 00:03:51.264
Luca（画外）：Alpha，Harland要她今晚过去。
Alpha. Harland demands her. Tonight.

00:03:53.976 --> 00:03:56.288
他：那就让他们当面听我的答复。
Then they'll hear my answer in person.

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:01.400
她：我跟你去，但你不许松开我的手。
Her: I'll go with you, but don't let go of my hand.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 14 轮 · Realtime round 14）

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:03.828
她：我跟你去。别松手。
I'll come. Don't let go.

00:04:04.028 --> 00:04:06.356
绝不。
Never.

00:04:08.566 --> 00:04:10.375
把她交出来，Magnus。族规比你古老。
Hand her over, Magnus. The law is older than you.

00:04:12.585 --> 00:04:14.394
那这条族规今晚就到此为止。她是我的Mate。
Then the law ends tonight. She is my Mate.
